<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2015/Trappe-Farm.jpg" alt="Plein air painting at Trappe Farm" width="450" height="350" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">The View from Trappe Farm, 8x10, oil on linen panel. 2015.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The first official paint-out of the season with Loudoun Sketch Club was a warm day. &nbsp;I found a nice location up the hill which had a view across the whole of the Loudoun Valley. After first doing a small color sketch of the same scene I laid this one down quickly with a palette knife then used a brush to work the edges.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Back in the studio I added the small run-in shed to strengthen the focal point.</p>